    "body": "Looks like neither the spec nor Chrome consider `target` in the download flow ([here's Chrome's code](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/html_anchor_element.cc;l=489;drc=d797bf0d91a1d137996640733d745fdd9eab4bf3)), which might simplify things.",
