    "updated_at": "2024-05-16T11:59:36Z",
    "body": "CSP is apparently applied differently between `download` and not-`download` in Chromium, see https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1862553\r\n\r\nAlso while I was investigating this, I found that the `initiator` value \"download\" (set [here](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#downloading-resources:concept-request-initiator)) appears to be dead code in the specs.",
